From 1912f13363e77eb693e54eb3903eacae4c746b2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TWRP Builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] audio: support a legacy HAL built with the Oreo audio.h

Android 9 inserted get_microphones() in front of dump() in audio_hw_device
and added flags to audio_port_config. For an Oreo module, read the table
through its own layout and pack port configs before handing them over.

Change-Id: I7392930260341624ba4313c83d13ce08c69368d2
---
